Please fix a CSS/PostCSS error that occurs during `npm run dev`.
The error is: `[vite:css][postcss] @import must precede all other statements (besides @charset or empty @layer)`

The problematic code looks like this:
```css
2459|    }
2460|  }
2461|  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');
2462|  body {
2463|    font-family: var(--font-sans);
```

Search for `https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap` in the workspace (likely in `src/` or similar styles directory). Move the `@import` statement to the very top of the file. Verify that `npm run dev` or a vite build works without this error.
Use the `attempt_completion` tool when you have fixed the issue, providing a summary of the fix.

